What it is: Hey! I made Right-Click Crops for Horizon 🌱

Harvest 16 plant families with a right-click: wheat, carrots, potatoes, beetroot, nether wart, cocoa, torchflower, pitcher crop, sugar cane, cactus, bamboo, kelp, twisting vines, weeping vines, pumpkins and melons!

Crops replant using an item from the harvest or your inventory. Tall plants keep their base, and pumpkin and melon stems stay put — harvest, move on, let it grow again. You can turn each plant on or off in the settings.

Works in single-player and LAN. Available on GitHub now, with addition to Horizon’s native mod catalog in progress!

